 R←Test_Alias_012(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ref;rc;msg;res;alias
⍝ Open a project with ]Cider.OpenProject [prefix*], the prefix matching exactly one alias.
⍝ No test covered this form; an interim change during 0.54.0 broke it with a VALUE ERROR.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP' ⋄ 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 alias←'test-alias-012'
 ##.Cider.AddAlias(∆ALIAS_TEMP_FOLDER,'/Project1')alias
 ref←∆GetRefToCommTools
 ref.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'
 ref.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'SureToOpen@' 'y'

 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD'OpenProject [',alias,'*] -watch=ns -batch -ignoreUserExec'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'#.TEMP')∊{⍵[;1]}##.Cider.ListOpenProjects 0

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ref.Cleanup
 {}⎕SE.Link.Break'#.TEMP'
 #.⎕EX'TEMP'
 {}##.Cider.DropAlias alias
⍝Done
